 "title": "Ikebana Experience , “Ichigo Ichie”-KAMAKURA",
 "description": "<p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\"><strong>Experience the Art of Ikebana in Kamakura with Master Koen Yokoi</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">Immerse yourself in &#34;Ichika Ichiei&#34; (One Flower, One Encounter)—a unique, 90-minute private floral workshop designed for exclusive small groups of 1 to 6 guests in the historic city of Kamakura.</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">PDF</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">Guided by Master Koen Yokoi, a third-generation Sogetsu Ikebana master with an illustrious career decorating stage productions, international events, and film sets, this private session offers a rare and intimate glimpse into the world of Japanese flower arrangement.</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">PDF</p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\"><strong>Tour Highlights &amp; Itinerary (90 minutes):</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">PDF</p><ol><li style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\"><strong>History &amp; Philosophy (30 mins):</strong> Learn about the rich heritage of Ikebana and the philosophy of the Sogetsu school, passed down through Master Yokoi’s distinguished family.PDF</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\"><strong>Hands-on Ikebana Workshop (30 mins):</strong> Watch an exclusive live demonstration by Master Yokoi, followed by your own hands-on session using fresh seasonal flowers and materials. Beginners are welcome with step-by-step personal guidance.PDF他 1 件</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\"><strong>Tea &amp; Conversation (30 mins):</strong> Relax and reflect over seasonal Japanese sweets and fresh tea while admiring your finished floral creation.PDF</li></ol><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\"><strong>What is Included:</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">PDF</p><ul><li style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">Private Ikebana instruction and demonstration by Master Koen YokoiPDF</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">English &amp; Japanese bilingual guide supportPDF</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">All flower materials, tools, and equipmentPDF</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">Matcha/Japanese tea and seasonal sweetsPDF</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">Free round-trip transfer within Kamakura &amp; Fujisawa citiesPDF</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#57646f;margin-top:0.5em;margin-bottom:0.5em\">Tour insurancePDF</li></ul>",
 "excerpt": "An exclusive, 90-minute private Ikebana experience in Kamakura guided by master artist Koen Yokoi, featuring hands-on flower arranging, tea, and seasonal sweets.",
